[statement]
A choice made for a name some package carries still steers a name the
request names: `y` 2, the best candidate for `y`, needs `w`, which only
`x` 1 provides, and apk takes `x` 1 for `x` over `x` 3. Contrast
`a-requested-name-some-package-carries-keeps-its-choice-against-a-provided-name`.

[repository]
P:x
V:3

P:x
V:1
p:w=2

P:y
V:2
D:w

P:y
V:1

[request]
x
y

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install x 1
install y 2
